---
import PageLayout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import FAQAccordion from '~/components/directory/FAQAccordion.astro';
import config from '~/config';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Advertise',
  description: `Get featured in the #1 deposition videographer directory. Attorneys in 50+ cities searching for videographers — put your business at the top.`,
};
---
<PageLayout metadata={metadata}>
  <Fragment slot="announcement"><span></span></Fragment>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-12 pb-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-default leading-tight">
        Attorneys in your city are searching for a videographer <em>right now.</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-xl text-muted">
        Without a Featured listing, they find your competitor first. DepoHire puts you at the top of results in your city — with quote requests routed directly to your inbox.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-amber-700 bg-amber-50 inline-block px-4 py-2 rounded-lg">
        Limited availability: We cap Featured listings at 2–3 per city to protect the value of each placement.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mt-10 max-w-3xl">
      <div>
        <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary">50+</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted">Cities covered</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary">1,000+</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted">Monthly attorney searches</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary">2–3</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted">Featured slots per city max</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary">$0</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted">Setup fees, ever</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Plans -->
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">

      <!-- Featured -->
      <div class="card p-6 border-2 border-primary">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-default">Featured City Listing</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-1">One job covers months of listing fees.</p>
        <div class="mt-4 mb-6">
          <span class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-default">$79</span>
          <span class="text-muted">/month</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            Pinned to #1 in your city results
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            "Featured" badge — visible immediately
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            Quote requests emailed directly to you
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            Extended bio + full service list
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            Direct booking link on your profile
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            CLVS badge (if applicable)
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            Monthly impressions report
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- City Pro -->
      <div class="card p-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-default">City Pro</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-1">Everything in Featured, plus editorial SEO + newsletter.</p>
        <div class="mt-4 mb-6">
          <span class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-default">$149</span>
          <span class="text-muted">/month</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            All Featured features
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            Named in "Best in [City]" guide post
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            Dofollow backlink to your website
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            Sponsor slot in monthly attorney email
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            Priority support & quarterly review
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Add-ons -->
    <div class="card p-6 mt-6">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-default mb-3">A La Carte Add-Ons</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-sm">
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold">Additional city</p>
          <p class="text-muted">$49/mo</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold">Newsletter spot (one-time)</p>
          <p class="text-muted">$99</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold">City guide mention (one-time)</p>
          <p class="text-muted">$149</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-4">We evaluate all applicants for professionalism, legal videography experience, and verifiable client history.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- Application Form -->
  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-12" id="advertise-form">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-default mb-6 text-center">Apply for a Featured Listing</h2>
      <form action={`mailto:${config.contactEmail}`} method="post" enctype="text/plain" class="space-y-4">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div>
            <label for="name" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Your Name</label>
            <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required class="mt-1 block w-full rounded-lg border-gray-300 shadow-sm focus:border-primary-500 focus:ring-primary-500 px-3 py-2 border" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="business" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Business Name</label>
            <input type="text" id="business" name="business" required class="mt-1 block w-full rounded-lg border-gray-300 shadow-sm focus:border-primary-500 focus:ring-primary-500 px-3 py-2 border" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="email" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Email Address</label>
          <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required class="mt-1 block w-full rounded-lg border-gray-300 shadow-sm focus:border-primary-500 focus:ring-primary-500 px-3 py-2 border" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="city" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Primary City / Metro</label>
          <input type="text" id="city" name="city" required placeholder="e.g. Chicago, IL" class="mt-1 block w-full rounded-lg border-gray-300 shadow-sm focus:border-primary-500 focus:ring-primary-500 px-3 py-2 border" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="plan" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Plan Interest</label>
          <select id="plan" name="plan" class="mt-1 block w-full rounded-lg border-gray-300 shadow-sm focus:border-primary-500 focus:ring-primary-500 px-3 py-2 border">
            <option value="featured">Featured Listing — $79/mo</option>
            <option value="citypro">City Pro — $149/mo</option>
            <option value="unsure">Not sure yet</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="message" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Anything else? (optional)</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="3" class="mt-1 block w-full rounded-lg border-gray-300 shadow-sm focus:border-primary-500 focus:ring-primary-500 px-3 py-2 border"></textarea>
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="btn-primary w-full justify-center">Apply for a Featured Listing &rarr;</button>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted text-center">We'll confirm availability in your city and follow up within one business day with next steps.</p>
      </form>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted text-center mt-4">No credit card needed &middot; Goes live in 2–3 business days &middot; Cancel anytime</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ROI -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-default">One job pays for months of listing fees.</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      The average deposition session pays $500–2,000. A Featured listing is $79/month. One booked job from DepoHire and you're profitable for the rest of the year.
    </p>
    <a href="#advertise-form" class="btn-primary inline-block mt-6 no-underline">Apply Now — It Takes 2 Minutes &rarr;</a>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <FAQAccordion faqs={[
      {
        question: 'Will this actually send me clients?',
        answer: "That depends on your city and how competitive you are on price and credibility. What we can say: every quote form submitted on your listing page is emailed directly to you — name, email, case type, and preferred date.",
      },
      {
        question: 'Who sees my listing?',
        answer: "Primarily litigation attorneys, paralegals, and legal ops professionals searching for deposition videographers in their city. Traffic is high-intent — people don't search 'deposition videographer Chicago' unless they're about to hire one.",
      },
      {
        question: 'Do I need to be CLVS certified?',
        answer: 'Preferred but not required. We evaluate all applicants on professional credentials and a verifiable track record in legal videography.',
      },
      {
        question: 'How long does setup take?',
        answer: 'Featured listings go live within 2–3 business days of approval.',
      },
      {
        question: 'Can I advertise in multiple cities?',
        answer: 'Yes — each additional city is $49/month on top of your base plan. Regional firms commonly list in 2–3 metros.',
      },
      {
        question: 'Is there a contract or setup fee?',
        answer: "No setup fee. No annual contract. Month-to-month with 30 days notice to cancel. We want you to stay because it's working, not because you're locked in.",
      },
    ]} />
  </section>
</PageLayout>
